WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.140
Kazune-kun's Midterm Test Plan

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.290
Thanks for the food!

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:43.460
Tonight's dinner was very good again, Kyuu-chan!

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.550
Thank you.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.430
I've made friends at school, the food is always great.

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:52.220
Ah, my days are finally happy.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.810
Ah, oh yeah.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.640
There's something important I haven't told you.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.520
Eh? What?

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.770
If you're one of the 20 lowest scores in the next test…

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.190
… you'll be expelled.

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.450
What's that?!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.410
Nice catch!

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.830
Why didn't you say that earlier?!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.040
Because you wouldn't know unless you tried it.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.460
Whether or not you liked that school.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.380
I guess… but…

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.010
And, if you were all worried about your grades from the beginning…

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:30.970
…you'd never have liked the school, would you?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:34.010
So I watched over you.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.230
Karin, do you like that school?

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.350
Do you really want to carry on going there?

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.270
Yes, I like it. I want to go.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.740
Then, for the next text…

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.490
Of course, I'll do my best! I have to do my best!

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:52.370
Good, I understand.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.580
Then I'll help you as best I can.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:58.000
T-Thank you, Kazune-kun.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.120
Now that that's been decided…

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.500
Weekly tests start next month.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.670
We can still do something about it.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.590
Anyways, start with these!

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:07.590
That's all you can do!

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:13.390
It's a good opportunity Karin-chan, you were always worried about your grades.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:16.020
Come on, let's get started.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.190
Eh? Expelled?

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.110
So that's why you're been studying so late everyday.

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:31.740
I never expected this school to be starting junior high school courses in primary school.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.120
Hey.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:36.040
Have you finished that English I gave you this morning?

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:38.250
You ran away during breakfast…

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.170
I'm doing this for you! Stop slacking.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.670
Make sure it's done before school ends.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:45.460
Otherwise I'll just give you more.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.840
Come on, let's go.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.170
Save me!!!

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.640
<u>Headband:</u> Victory.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.640
That demon…

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.890
They came out… the Kazunezu…

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:02.190
Hanazono-san! Stop clinging to Kujyou-kun!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.360
Exactly what are you to Kujyou-kun?

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:05.940
Uh…

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:08.480
I've been living with him up until today!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.400
What?!

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:13.660
Whatever I say is putting my life in danger…

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:15.240
This is for safety…

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:19.290
Uh… you see… I'm a distant relative…

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.620
You're a relative?

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.540
Oh my… did they figure it out?

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:25.960
Unfair!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:30.460
To disregard us, who have been with Kujyou-kun since elementary school.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.180
For a relative to suddenly transfer in like that…

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:34.930
It's so unfair!

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:37.720
Um…

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:42.770
Anyway, if anything happens to Kujyou-kun, you won't have it easy!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.410
Hey! Why do we have to do this kind of work?!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.790
Isn't this kind of work what the student council is all about?

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.830
Here, I've done my 500.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:06.250
Such simple work… it's such a pain!

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:11.130
Didn't you take the position because "It would be easy to investigate Kujyou-kun and the others"?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:16.430
Yes, but if I have time to be doing this work, I should be getting that amateur goddess…

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:19.930
Now that you mention it, do you really think she got in here though the entrance exams?

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:21.180
You think I care?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:26.020
The transfer exams here aren't exactly a breeze to pass, right?

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.150
Maybe they passed her based on her cute face.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:35.110
Kirika, it's been worrying me for awhile now, but aren't you getting along a bit too well with that amateur goddess?

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.410
She's our enemy!

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:39.870
When I look at her, I just seem to smile.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.370
Stop being so carefree.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:45.210
Listen, if you keep being so easygoing, you're going to mess up.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.880
I suppose. I'll be careful.

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.130
Is it okay to start with the next pile?

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:55.220
I'm home.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:57.930
It's finally over.

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:00.890
Karin-chan! Welcome home!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:02.640
Did you do them?

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:06.480
I did! You didn't have to wait for me here!

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.150
Ah, good.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.360
Here's the next one.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.650
Can't you give me a little less?

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.780
It can't be helped, you're been scoring badly since elementary school.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.410
Well, I'm stupid.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.080
If you don't want to do it, don't.

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:27.330
W-What was that?!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.290
Nya-nya-nya, looks like you've got it tough, Karin-chan!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:33.420
Well, it seems like all that slacking finally caught up with you.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:38.940
It annoys me when you talk! You… you… you…

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:47.730
Um…

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:48.810
Are you done?

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.600
Next is this.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.860
You know, you don't have to watch over me this late into the night.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.740
If I don't, you'll start slacking, right?

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.860
No, I wouldn't!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.370
Damn, he figured it out.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.790
Karin-chan, Kazune-chan…

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.790
I made some onigiri for a late night meal.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.750
Oh, thanks.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.500
Himeka-chan… this late…

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.920
And afterwards, these are for dessert.

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.640
Ah! Kashimamoshi!

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.180
I'm also cheering for you!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.930
Well, do your best!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.310
Thanks.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.860
Okay, let's continue.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:36.030
Yeah!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.620
Kujyou-kun.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.290
Kujyou-kun.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:55.540
Ah, yes?

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:57.840
What should be put in here?

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:02.470
Ah… Um… I'm sorry, please repeat the question.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:02.760
You must listen in the first place!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.550
You must listen in the first place!

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.600
Tests start tomorrow you know!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.850
I'm sorry.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.690
Kazune-kun.

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.780
This is yesterdays…

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.440
Ah, where?

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:22.530
Over here.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:26.580
You got it wrong again.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:28.450
You did this the day before yesterday as well.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.040
Go try again.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.960
He didn't have to be so mean about it.

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:40.050
Hey.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.470
W-What?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.550
What do you mean "What"?

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:47.010
Kujyou-kun has had no ambition recently!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.430
Huh? Ambition?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:53.850
Yes! Kujyou-kun's charm, that is…

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:57.570
His overwhelming confidence that guides him.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.520
As well as…

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:01.110
His loud, toned voice!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.860
However, Hanazono-san, it's your fault…

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:05.410
Eh?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.950
Even though it's close to tests, he sleeps in all his breaks.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.330
And even when he's awake, he's paying no attention.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:17.080
Kujyou-kun has his own studies, but he's purposefully helping you with yours!

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:22.170
Give back the bright, shining Kujyou-kun!

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:26.760
Give back the Kujyou-kun that made us happy!

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:28.510
Even if you say that…

00:09:28.510 --> 00:09:33.350
Anyway, if Kujyou-kun's grades fall in this test, don't think you'll have it easy.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.030
Karin-chan!

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.780
Let's go have lunch.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.410
No, I'm fine.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:53.950
What's the matter? Are you not feeling well?

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.460
I'm sorry, Kazune-kun.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:58.000
Karin?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.460
I've caused you lots of trouble.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:09.140
I wonder what's wrong with Karin-chan.

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.640
No idea.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:19.060
Hanazono-san, it's your fault…

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.980
Kujyou-kun has his own studies, but…

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:24.570
If Kujyou-kun's grades fall in this test, don't think you'll have it easy.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.190
Why! Test this, test that.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.820
Ah, studying for a test?

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.040
Hello. We seem to meet often.

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:45.090
Kazune-chan…

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:49.470
Ah, sorry, I think I'm going to go get some sleep.

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:57.310
I guess you really do get tired doing that everyday.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.730
Maybe I made Karin do too much as well…

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:10.110
That Kirika, leaving me to finish all this work.

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.370
Where the heck did he go?!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:14.740
What's this?

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:25.130
Transfer students whose names appear on the left who do not produce results in the upcoming test, will be expelled.

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.990
Hanazono Karin

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:33.510
I see, so that's why you're depressed.

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:38.350
I never even asked Kazune-kun to help me study, but…

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:45.400
…I caused him so much trouble.

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:47.610
Senpai?

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:52.700
You're…

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.740
Kazune-kun…

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.040
Have you done that problem you showed me earlier?

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:02.460
Ah, sorry… not yet.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.220
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.760
I am God!

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:19.720
You moron.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.720
It's a croquette!

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:22.020
What should I do…

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:25.690
I said such mean things to Kazune-kun.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:33.610
I must be the worst girl in the world.

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:00.520
What's with this reaction?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:10.990
What are you intending to do? You're planning something, right?

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:14.950
So you noticed, but I have no business with you today.

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:16.660
Don't tell me… Karin?

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.240
I'll pluck the sprout while it's still young.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:25.460
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:36.640
If the amateur goddess Hanazono Karin has bad grades in tomorrow's midterms, she will be expelled, correct?

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.890
You don't intend to interfere, do you?

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:42.560
Ah! I could do that, couldn't I!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.350
Thanks for telling me!

00:13:44.350 --> 00:13:45.480
You…

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.150
I'm not "You", I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:49.520
I'll defeat you here!

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:52.990
Really? Then I'll give you all I've got.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.640
Move, Kujyou!

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:04.120
I will not move!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:10.540
I don't think Kazune-kun would even forgive me if I apologized.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.800
But you are sorry, right?

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:14.720
Yes.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.180
What if you spoke to him about it.

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:21.490
But… Kazune-kun seemed really angry.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:25.140
Don't worry, I'm sure he'll understand.

00:14:26.020 --> 00:14:32.270
If you really want to make up, nothing will happen unless you try.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.070
I guess so.

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:38.610
I'm going to go and speak to Kazune-kun!

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.660
Will it be… okay?

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:48.790
It will be okay.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.500
He's your friend, right? Kujyou-kun.

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.710
Do you know Kazune-kun?

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:58.010
Because I help out with the student council work.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.680
Ah… you are…

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.720
I'm Hanazono Karin.

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.640
My name is Karasuma Kirika, a third year.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.310
It's nice to meet you, Karin-chan.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:06.850
Me too!

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:12.820
Karasuma…

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:19.200
Karasuma… Kirika…

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:22.780
What a cool name!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.080
Karin-chan!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.080
Kirika-senpai, huh?

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:26.950
Karin-chan!

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.250
Karin-chan, come on!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.790
Karin-chan!!!

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:32.790
What is it, Shii-chan?!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.880
Just when I got to have a good time with Kirika-senpai!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.880
Now is not the time for that!

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.300
What's wrong?

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:43.550
I felt the power of a god in that direction, so I rushed to find you!

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.180
The power of a god?

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:46.930
Yes!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:49.770
But the power was so big, it seemed like fighting.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.060
I thought it was you!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.230
Fighting?

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:56.610
If it's not me… Kazune-kun!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:10.120
We're this far into the battle and you still haven't transformed, are you making fun of me?

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:13.130
There is no way a human can beat a god.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:22.610
There he is… Kazune-kun!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:24.850
Nya~ this looks bad!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.760
You wait here, Karin-chan!

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:28.470
Kazune-kun!

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.350
Nyake!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:33.730
What?

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:41.610
Are you alright?

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:47.490
As I thought, if I'm not with Athenya, my powers won't work.

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:48.790
Shii-chan!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.330
But anyway, why hasn't Kazune-kun transformed?

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:52.920
Don't tell me…

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:57.880
…he's worried about tomorrow's test, seen as transforming makes his body really worn out.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:02.720
Cut it out. What do you intend to accomplish without using your god powers?

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:06.640
There are times when without using your god powers…

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:10.680
…you can still protect something!

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:18.520
I won't let you lay one finger on Karin.

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:19.940
Could it be…

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:26.620
Fine then. Let me show your body how foolish it is to face me without transforming.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.290
Is Kazune-kun doing this for me?..

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:36.710
Is he not transforming because he won't be able to help me study tonight?

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:47.850
For someone who said such cruel thing to him…

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:52.430
I am God!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:18.670
Karin.

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:20.490
Kazune-kun, I've come to save you!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:23.300
Idiot! You can't even fight, remember!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.090
No, I won't run.

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:26.180
Karin.

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:33.720
I'm always following behind, I'm always a pain.

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:39.480
Karin.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:42.780
Everyone's trying so hard for me.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.400
But, I'm always…

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.530
That's so unfair!

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:50.590
I understand now, I can't just rely on everyone else.

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.870
I also have to try my best!

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.290
Heh, like a summer bug drawn to a flame.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:03.460
God Thunder!

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.390
A bluff?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:24.730
God Thunder! God Thunder! God Thunder! …

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:22.860
As I expected, there is no need to fear an amateur goddess.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:25.900
Karin, that's still impossible for you!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:27.320
Why?!

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:28.820
Why isn't it coming out?!

00:19:28.820 --> 00:19:31.530
Well then, let me try.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:32.490
Karin!

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:33.740
Karin-chan!

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.460
God Thun-der!

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:40.540
It came out!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:45.300
Eh? Why are you going that way?!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.760
Idiot, where are you aiming?

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.640
Kazune-kun!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:01.810
We did it…

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.900
Curse you, amateur goddess.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:09.570
You're…

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:16.160
Kazune-kun!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:20.330
Karin… being so reckless…

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.000
But… well done…

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.000
Kazune-kun!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.840
Kazune-kun, I'm sorry.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.430
I said such mean things to you.

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.810
I'm sure you're still angry.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.150
The truth is… I never really meant that.

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:46.610
I'm really glad that you watched over me.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:50.780
Thank you.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:03.080
In tomorrow's test… even if I don't do well, I'm going to do my best so I have no regrets.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:09.090
Tch, what a moron.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:13.010
I'm sorry. I said such mean things to you.

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:16.600
I wasn't angry about that.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.140
I was angry about…

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.980
Okay, I'm going to hand out the test results.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:29.570
I've done all I can.

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:31.860
I mustn't regret those hell-filled days.

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:33.890
Karin-chan…

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:35.280
You can do it!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.290
Here I go!

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:49.250
Win!

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:51.210
Really?

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:55.260
Wow! You're 30th from the bottom!

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:59.470
Yay... I can stay in this school!

00:22:00.180 --> 00:22:02.600
Well done! You should be proud of yourself.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:04.980
Let me congratulate her too!

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:09.400
No, it's because all of you supported me!

00:22:09.400 --> 00:22:11.440
Now it's my turn to thank you!

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:15.860
So, is this your thanks?

00:22:18.160 --> 00:22:22.700
Karin-chan… what's this?

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:27.380
Um… Eel… Saute.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.000
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.000
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:04.360
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:04.360
…with the ring shining.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.530
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.530
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:52.580
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:52.580
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:12.060
Dosukoi,
The Love Filled School Festival

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.310
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:12.060
Dosukoi! The Love Filled School Festival!

00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:14.070
I'm looking forward to the school festival!

00:24:14.070 --> 00:24:16.400
Because we have no classes!

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:19.780
But anyway, what's with that "Dosukoi"?
